sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Admin
    participant B as Browser (React)
    participant S as Server (Express)
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    A->>B: Buka halaman Laporan Penjualan
    A->>B: Pilih rentang tanggal (start_date, end_date)
    B->>S: GET /api/reports?start_date=2026-06-01&end_date=2026-06-10

    S->>S: Middleware auth & adminOnly

    S->>DB: SELECT orders WHERE status IN ('paid','processing','completed')<br/>AND created_at BETWEEN start_date AND end_date<br/>JOIN tables, order_items, menus
    DB-->>S: Daftar orders + items

    S->>S: Hitung totalRevenue = SUM(total_amount)
    S->>S: Hitung totalOrders = COUNT(orders)
    S->>S: Hitung avgOrderValue = totalRevenue / totalOrders
    S->>S: Hitung bestSellers: GROUP BY menu nama, SUM qty, TOP 10

    S-->>B: Response {totalRevenue, totalOrders, avgOrderValue, bestSellers, orders}

    B-->>A: Tampilkan laporan:<br/>• Statistik ringkasan<br/>• Grafik menu terlaris<br/>• Tabel detail pesanan